{"availability":"available","full":"muhammadhassan-web/ai-support-chatbot","name":"ai-support-chatbot","description":"Embeddable AI customer support chat widget that answers from a business's own knowledge base — built on a demo plumbing site (Next.js + Groq/Llama)","category":"Business","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":2,"created":"2026-08-16T08:08:06Z","updated":"2026-08-16T16:40:14Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ai-support-chatbot-plum.vercel.app","topics":["ai-chatbot","ai-chatbot-development-companies","ai-chatbot-saas","chat-widget","customer-support","customer-support-ai","customer-support-assistant","customer-support-automation","customer-support-chatbot","groq-ai","groq-api","groq-integration","javascript","llama","nextjs","rag","rag-chatbot","rag-pipeline","react","reactjs"],"demo":"https://ai-support-chatbot-plum.vercel.app/embed-demo.html","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.920Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.920Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.920Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.920Z","stars":0,"forks":2}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Most small businesses don't need a full AI product — they need one thing: a chatbot on their website that actually knows their prices, hours, and policies instead of giving generic, made-up answers. This project is a portfolio build showing exactly that service end-to-end.","It's a complete, working example: a small business website (\"AquaFix Plumbing,\" a fictional plumbing company) with a floating AI chat widget in the bottom-right corner. Ask it about pricing, hours, service area, or emergency callouts, and it answers from that business's real data — not a generic ChatGPT wrapper. Ask it something outside that scope (like car repair), and it correctly says so and hands off to a human instead of making something up.","The point of building it this way — a real site plus a portable widg